<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the</p>
<p>following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek</p>
<p>mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices,</p>
<p>as well as total net asset sizes as of June 2.</p>
<p>				    June 2/May 30   June 2/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.11		 6.90</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.08		 5.13</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.38		 9.78</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			    0.50		56.91</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			    1.40		31.90</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  1.47		32.49</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.92		11.75</p>
<p>  Growth funds			   -0.43		27.28</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			    1.49		39.29</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  1.57		37.80</p>
<p>  International funds		   1.24		20.10</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.05		95.30</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual</p>
<p>funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31,</p>
<p>1991.</p>
<p>NET ASSET SIZES (in drachmas)</p>
<p>  Total market				  5,297,272,367,866</p>
<p>  Fixed income funds			  1,929,015,611,899</p>
<p>  Money market funds			  3,034,246,178,598</p>
<p>  International funds			    94,409,774,621</p>
<p>  Growth funds				    239,600,802,749</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
